From: Serj Targarien <xergy10@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: run the RGB20SX's first card slot at SDR50

Some cards fail SDR104 tuning in the first slot of the Powkiddy RGB20SX
("mmc1: tuning execution failed: -5"), after which the card is never
initialised. SDR50 tunes reliably.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-powkiddy-rgb20sx.dts	2026-11-05 16:34:43.530418155 +0100
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-powkiddy-rgb20sx.dts	2026-11-05 16:34:43.532394394 +0100
@@ -87,3 +87,12 @@
 &uart2 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+/*
+ * basesq: some cards fail SDR104 tuning in this slot ("tuning execution failed: -5"),
+ * after which the kernel never sees the card. SDR50 (100 MHz) tunes reliably.
+ */
+&sdmmc0 {
+	/delete-property/ sd-uhs-sdr104;
+	sd-uhs-sdr50;
+};
